# Backup contents — local only (Time Machine / external backup, not git)
# Real backups (manifest.json, diff.patch, status.txt, log.txt, notes.md)
# under <TS>/<reason>/ dirs are ignored. Anything we want to keep tracked
# is whitelisted below.

# Ignore everything in this dir by default
*

# Track this file itself so the rules persist for clones
!*.gitignore

# Whitelist: protocol docs and template stay tracked
!README.md
!_template/
!_template/**
